<title>HONG KONG: Jet Air raises stake in Shanghai JV.</title>
<headline>Jet Air raises stake in Shanghai JV.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jet Air International Group Ltd said on Tuesday it has raised its stake in its joint venture Shanghai Jin Hai-Jet Air International Forwarding Co Ltd to 45 percent from 26 percent.</p>
<p>The HK$22.8 million purchase would strengthen the group's earnings and signified a move to take a greater role in its business in China, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said its joint venture would develop its logistics operation from Shanghai and provide comprehensive services.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6441  http://www.hk97.com</p>
